My mokkori doesn't work on it!

312
00:23:53,160 --> 00:23:55,300
See! It's a secret aura.

313
00:23:55,300 --> 00:23:56,630
City Hunter 2:

314
00:23:56,630 --> 00:23:59,500
"Mokkori Killer?
The Princess's Noble Aura (Part 1)"

315
00:23:59,500 --> 00:24:01,470
If you don't watch it, you're going
